(7649906, 1244216, 63218, '<td valign="top">Hi Joanne! I was glancing thru the results of this challenge getting bored by one landscape after another, when I came upon this delight. My favorite, white flower/black BG. Yay! Then I saw you are  the photog--double Yay! If I''d voted, you''d have one more 10. :D</td>', 'Hi Joanne! I was glancing thru the results of this challenge getting bored by one landscape after another, when I came upon this delight. My favorite, white flower/black BG. Yay! Then I saw you are  the photog--double Yay! If I''d voted, you''d have one more 10. :D', '2020-01-08 10:14:58.000000', NULL, 0),
(7649981, 1244173, 112739, '<td valign="top">AS far as I am concerned, this is the only image meeting the challenge topic of using high dynamic range techniques. You have great control of highlights and beautiful details in the shadows. Nothing is blocked up, like the top 5 images. Should have finished much higher.</td>', 'AS far as I am concerned, this is the only image meeting the challenge topic of using high dynamic range techniques. You have great control of highlights and beautiful details in the shadows. Nothing is blocked up, like the top 5 images. Should have finished much higher.', '2020-01-08 16:55:55.000000', NULL, 0),
(7650074, 1244243, 173844, '<td valign="top">Many fine images in this challenge, and HDR processing often subtly used to draw out and enhance the mood, but your image stands out for me.  HDR and emotion, here endearing joy, combine in support of each other to terrific effect.  It''s as if the boys'' happiness, shining eyes and all, is being made available to us, in case we''ve forgotten what it''s like.<br/>Personal favorite of the challenge.</td>', 'Many fine images in this challenge, and HDR processing often subtly used to draw out and enhance the mood, but your image stands out for me.  HDR and emotion, here endearing joy, combine in support of each other to terrific effect.  It''s as if the boys'' happiness, shining eyes and all, is being made available to us, in case we''ve forgotten what it''s like.Personal favorite of the challenge.', '2020-01-09 08:45:02.000000', NULL, 0),
